  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Welcome to Benguela Bags</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><br>At Benguela Bags, we craft elegant neoprene bags designed for every occasion. Inspired by the dynamic Benguela Current along Africa's southern coast, our bags embody both strength and fluidity.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Our Mission</strong></span><br>Based in vibrant Durban, we blend local flair with global trends to create stylish, durable accessories that complement every woman's lifestyle. Whether you're heading to the office, beach, or a night out, our bags are your perfect companion.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Why Neoprene?</strong></span><br>Neoprene is not only trendy but also practical&mdash;it's lightweight, water-resistant, and resilient. Our commitment to quality ensures that each bag meets the highest standards of design and functionality.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Let's Talk Business!</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Passionate about travel and living life to the absolute fullest? We'd love to partner with adventurous women who embody that spirit of exploration and joy.</li>\r\n<li>10% commision can be negotiated on based on track record and working relationship.</li>\r\n<li>Payments can be made via bank deposit and made monthly. Payment dates can be negotiated.</li>\r\n</ol>",
